id=triango_arm32_bridge
name=Triango ARM32 Bridge
version=v1.2.2-b
versionCode=12020
author=MuhammedAliMizrakTR
description=Arm32 (armeabi-v7a) support for 64-bit-only Qualcomm SoCs: NativeBridge (libtriango_native_bridge) + JIT/interpreter engine (libtriango_nb_engine) with VFP/NEON, GPU thunk layer, NO_MATCHING_ABIS fix (direct APK install). LateLoad-compatible, soft-reboot activation, WebUI. Target: Galaxy S26 Ultra (m3q, SM8850-AC).
